      "title": "Find the exact area separately",
      "body": "<p>Split the V-shaped graph at its vertex into triangles, then subtract the true area from your estimate.</p>",
      "recap": "A modulus changes formula at its corner; splitting there gives the correct area of each piece.",
      "pitfall": "The specified excess is estimate minus true value, not their sum.",
